{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"5332","name":"桑顿【动物防治专家】","desc":"桑顿【动物防治专家】","icon_url":"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/12/04/160491137/446f74fc9ba275a987698e210f6479fd_5257350757801160128.png","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"桑顿","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"npc_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"性别\",\"value\":[\"男\"]},{\"key\":\"位置\",\"value\":[\"卡萨扎莱宫南郊\"]},{\"key\":\"功能\",\"value\":[\"暂无\"]},{\"key\":\"相关任务\",\"value\":[\"「凶猛动物在哪里」\"]},{\"key\":\"职业\",\"value\":[\"动物防治专家\"]}],\"extra_attr\":[{\"key\":\"编者注：\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e你到底是真专家还是假专家？\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"心声：\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e真想看看那些传闻里的动物⋯\u003c/p\u003e\"]}],\"image\":\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/12/04/160491137/a68bc2847c83efa908ce707b436cf4b1_8633922264737119286.png\"}\n","style":""}],"id":"1207","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"角色展示","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"NPC截图\",\"image\":\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/12/04/160491137/23a40fbf520eca9aefdc592b26dc81e4_5018158872457975378.png\"},{\"tab_name\":\"位置\",\"image\":\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/12/04/160491137/aa7d6860554ed209f681cf3330dba28d_8497997072837881847.png\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"1208","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"商品列表","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1209","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"NPC对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size:22px\\\"\u003e【完成世界任务「凶猛动物在哪里」前】\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e【开场白】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e怎么样，你遇到那些凶猛动物了吗？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e遇到的话就请你帮忙驱逐掉那些凶猛动物吧⋯「凶猛动物防治」，可是件有利于居民和动物双方的有益之举。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e【关于「\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(0,0,0,1)\\\"\u003e鳄鱼大王」\u003c/span\u003e】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e据说「鳄鱼大王」就在城东边的水域附近⋯不过似乎很是狡猾，我去了好几次都没有见到啊⋯\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(0,0,0,1)\\\"\u003e【关于「长鬓虎罗阇」⋯】\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e附近似乎都在传「长鬓虎罗阇」的故事，说在夜半时分，它会从西边的森林里跑出来，抓走那些不愿乖乖睡觉的顽皮鬼⋯\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e虽然后面大概是父母吓唬孩子的说辞，不过据说「长鬓虎」在夜间确实会更活跃一些⋯\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e听说有半夜赶路的旅人就曾经看到过那只巨大的「长鬓虎」，被追了好一段路，好在没有出什么事⋯\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(0,0,0,1)\\\"\u003e【关于「驮兽大王」⋯】\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e听说一些野生驮兽有很强的领地概念，陌生人一旦进入领地就会受到它们的攻击，恐怕「驮兽大王」也一样。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e它的领地就在东边的某个区域⋯\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e究竟多大的驮兽能够被人叫作「驮兽大王」，真是让人在意啊⋯\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(0,0,0,1)\\\"\u003e【还在调查⋯】\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e是嘛，那就继续加油吧！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size:22px\\\"\u003e【完成世界任务「凶猛动物在哪里」后】\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e【开场白】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e欸呀，这不是旅行者吗，真是多亏了你，最近村民出行都放心许多了···\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1210","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"card_group_info","layout":"","data":"{\"author\":\"\",\"created_at\":\"\",\"list\":[]}\n","style":""}],"id":"1211","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","wit